WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:01.480
It's Oscar time.

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:02.380
Sunday night

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:03.360
Hollywood will give

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.831
famous people awards

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:05.800
for what they say

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:06.520
are the

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.160
best performances,

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:09.760
but Oscars leave out

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.100
political actors.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.220
Not fair.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.300
Politicians deceive people just like

00:00:14.309 --> 00:00:15.240
actors do

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.100
and some of their performances

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.831
deserve recognition,

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:19.980
if not Oscars,

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:20.800
at least a

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.120
Stosscar.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.385
So here are this year's

00:00:23.385 --> 00:00:24.960
Stosscar Awards.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.060
The award for

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:27.280
Best Performance

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:27.980
by a

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:29.360
Rich Elitist goes to

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.080
House Minority Leader

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.640
Nancy Pelosi.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.180
In her eagerness to

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:39.000
trash Trump's tax cuts,

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:39.816
she described

00:00:39.816 --> 00:00:41.260
thousand dollar bonuses

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:42.680
as "crumbs".

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.660
Crumbs

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:44.880
that they are giving

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:45.960
to workers

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.820
to kinda put the schmooze on

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:49.480
is so pathetic.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:50.900
The award for Best Performance

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.180
by a Democrat

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:52.980
goes to

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:54.680
San Francisco District Attorney

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.320
George Gascon.

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.600
After California legalized weed,

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.480
the DA promised to drop

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:03.100
3,000 marijuana convictions,

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:04.520
and he made getting them dropped

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:05.200
easy

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.420
on the poor guys sitting in jail.

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:09.220
The process will take no hearings,

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:11.460
people will not have to hire attorneys,

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:14.060
they will never have to come to our courts.

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:15.980
We believe that it's the right thing to do

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:17.620
and it's the just thing to do.

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:19.350
And speaking of doing the right thing,

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:20.600
the Stosscar for

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.226
Best Performance by the President

00:01:22.226 --> 00:01:23.549
goes to the moment when

00:01:23.549 --> 00:01:25.080
President Trump said,

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:26.380
"We have cut

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:27.500
22

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.520
burdensome

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:29.980
regulations

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:30.831
for every

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:31.520
one

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:32.220
new

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:33.340
rule.

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:34.320
Great.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:36.280
I wish you'd cut the new rules too,

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:38.240
but I'll take what I can get.

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:39.860
After all, he also chose

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:41.160
Jeff Sessions

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:43.020
to be his Attorney General,

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.040
and Sessions wins

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:45.200
the Stosscar

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:45.740
for

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:48.260
Worst Praise for Government Abuse

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:49.439
for saying this about

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:50.840
asset forfeiture:

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.300
"I love that program.

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.834
Man we had so much fun doing that

00:01:53.834 --> 00:01:56.023
and taking the drug dealers money."

00:01:56.023 --> 00:01:57.180
So much fun?

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:59.620
Taking billions of dollars from people,

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:00.700
most of whom

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:02.940
never even got a trial?

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:04.000
That's a crime,

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.580
not good government.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:08.100
Yet both parties like it

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.240
and that isn't even the worst example of

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:11.960
bipartisanship.

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:13.660
We have worked well together.

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:15.780
The Stosscar for the Worst Act of

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.046
Bipartisanship goes to

00:02:17.046 --> 00:02:18.320
Senators Chuck Schumer

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:19.420
and Mitch McConnell

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:20.860
for their budget deal.

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:22.120
This budget deal

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:24.460
is the first real sprout

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:26.080
of bipartisanship.

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.340
I particularly want to thank my friend

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:30.440
the Democratic leader.

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:31.650
I hope we can build on

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:33.140
this bipartisan momentum.

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:34.620
No, please don't.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:35.860
You've already added

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:36.940
billions to our

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:38.637
unsustainable debt

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:39.400
and cut

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:41.140
almost nothing.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.500
Does any politician

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:43.412
ever

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:44.380
say no

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:46.200
to more government?

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.781
Well yes, one has.

00:02:47.781 --> 00:02:49.100
Rand Paul

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.260
gets a Stosscar

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:50.760
for

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:53.460
Best Defense of the Constitution.

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:55.680
Paul demanded the NSA and FBI

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:56.980
get warrants

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:57.760
before they

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.460
spy on Americans.

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:02.060
Do we really want all of our phone calls recorded

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:03.740
and then have the ability of the government

00:03:03.745 --> 00:03:05.010
to bring you in and ask

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:06.960
you questions about your phone calls

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:08.700
and if you're not perfectly accurate in

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:10.080
recording your phone calls,

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.003
you could go to prison?

00:03:12.003 --> 00:03:13.890
All we're asking for is that

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:14.880
for Americans

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.760
the Constitution should be in order.

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:18.100
But the Constitution

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.360
bores people,

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.060
so spying on Americans

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:22.500
continues.

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:23.680
Next, the

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:24.860
Stosscar for

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:27.140
Best Democrat on Free Speech

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.260
goes to

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:30.140
Senator Elizabeth Warren,

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.370
who after joining left wingers and

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:34.400
vilifying a conservative

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:35.500
then said,

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:37.006
"I think it's dangerous

00:03:37.006 --> 00:03:38.460
to suppress speech.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:40.900
First, suppression can backfire

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:43.180
instead of shutting up individuals

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:44.479
with disgusting views.

00:03:44.479 --> 00:03:46.340
It becomes a launching pad

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:47.900
to national attention.

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:48.560
Second,

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:50.960
suppression suggests weakness.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.489
It makes us sound afraid,

00:03:52.489 --> 00:03:53.760
like we're afraid

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.180
that we can't defeat

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:56.740
evil ideas

00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:58.380
with good ideas.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.180
Good point.

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:00.820
The way to fight bad ideas

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:01.540
is with

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:02.840
good ideas.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.620
Unfortunately her ideas are usually

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:07.160
not good ideas.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:09.480
And that brings us to the Stosscar for

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:10.980
Worst Performance

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:12.560
by a President.

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:13.813
That goes to

00:04:13.813 --> 00:04:14.840
Narcissus.

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:16.056
No, wrong picture.

00:04:16.056 --> 00:04:16.556
I meant

00:04:16.556 --> 00:04:17.609
President Trump

00:04:17.609 --> 00:04:18.280
for

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:20.020
bragging like a child in

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:21.660
tweet after tweet.

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:22.800
Don't misunderstand,

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:23.800
the Stosscar judges

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.200
love his tweeting

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.440
but some are

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:27.900
repulsive.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.300
He's a genius.

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:30.180
He

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:32.160
ended the assault on Christmas.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.980
And because he got strict

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:35.125
on commercial aviation,

00:04:35.125 --> 00:04:35.922
there have been

00:04:35.922 --> 00:04:37.380
zero deaths.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:38.360
Give me a break.

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:39.184
He hasn't even

00:04:39.184 --> 00:04:39.840
done anything

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.920
that affected aviation.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:44.400
Finally,

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.580
just as the Oscars give out one lifetime

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:47.720
achievement award,

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.860
this year's Stosscars conclude

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:51.120
with an award to a politician

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:52.940
who consistently has

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:54.500
fought for liberty.

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:57.520
It's trillions of dollars we're spending on these wars!

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:58.820
Congressman Ron Paul

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:01.260
has taken every opportunity he can

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:02.280
to challenge

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:03.640
enemies of liberty.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:05.440
I don't understand this division,

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.140
why you may defend

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.040
social liberty

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:08.700
and liberties

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:09.450
rather well,

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.560
but as soon as it comes

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:11.900
to me spending my money

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:12.980
and assuming responsibility.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:14.092
He fought to limit

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:15.240
executive power.

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:17.720
Why don't we just open up the Constitution

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:18.680
and read it?

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.460
You're not allowed to go to war without a

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:21.720
declaration of war.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:22.560
And he fought the

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:23.940
political bipartisanship

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:25.940
that's bankrupting America.

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:27.390
And we've had way too much

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.582
bipartisanship

00:05:28.582 --> 00:05:31.160
for about 60 years.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.399
Ron Paul deserves

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:33.380
several Stosscars

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:33.930
for

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.620
fighting for freedom.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:37.197
Now my time is up.

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:38.340
That's the Stosscars

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:39.420
for this year.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.760
you

